{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find, take and check object. If object is valid, perform task. Move to new location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectValid    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
